==============================================================================
  [4]  CONFIRMATION WITHOUT THE SURROGATE
==============================================================================

  The Cantera column of the consistency test checks the prediction at
  a given x. It does not check x itself, because x came out of the
  surrogate. Repeating the fit with Cantera in place of the network is
  the only check on the optimized parameters. Starting from the
  surrogate optimum, so this converges in a few iterations.

  --- optimized parameters with and without the surrogate -----------------
      parameter      surrogate     Cantera   difference    in sd   physical difference
      lnA_R1           -0.1446     -0.0732      +0.0714     0.83   A factor x 1.1787
      Ea_R1            -0.1122     -0.0536      +0.0587     0.65   Ea +293 cal/mol
      lnA_R2           -0.0121     -0.0370      -0.0249     0.16   A factor x 0.9442
